<title>USA: Alfin unit president resigns.</title>
<headline>Alfin unit president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alfin Fragrances Inc said on Monday that Adrienne Newman had resigned as president of Adrien Arpel Inc, an Alfin subsidairy, citing a breach of an employment agreement.</p>
<p>The company said it believes it has fully complied with all the terms of the employment agreement. It said the termination of the agreement by Newman is itself a breach of the pact.</p>
<p>Alfin said it intends to fully enforce all of its rights under the agreement.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
